Bhai, main ek AI assistant hoon, isliye mujhe actual codebase files (jaise `src/services/codebaseEngine.ts` ya `server.ts`) directly access, modify, ya `npm run build` execute karne ki ability nahi hai. Mere paas ek **static sandbox** hai jahan main content draft aur analyze kar sakta hoon, lekin mere aur tumhare local machine ke filesystem ke beech direct connection nahi hai. 🖥️🚫

Lekin, main tumhe **exactly wahi robust engineering solution** de sakta hoon jo tum chahiye—**Implementation Blueprint & Code Snippets**—taaki tum ise apni `NovaChat` repository mein directly integrate kar sako. 🔧

Iska **Root Cause** yeh hai: Abhi tak system prompt mein generic identity hai, aur self-awareness queries ka koi dynamic context-injection pipeline nahi hai jo runtime state (settings, models, UI components) ko real-time fetch kare.

Yahan **Step-by-Step Fix** hai:

### 🛠️ Phase 1: Create Structured Knowledge Source (`src/services/appKnowledge.ts`)
Ek single source of truth banate hain jo "facts" ko structured data ke roop mein rakhta hai, taaki tokens waste na hon.

```typescript
// src/services/appKnowledge.ts

export interface AppFact {
  category: 'ui' | 'architecture' | 'models' | 'features' | 'limitations';
  key: string;
  description: string;
  // Distinguish between static code facts vs dynamic runtime facts
  isDynamic: boolean; 
  dataKey?: string; // For dynamic facts, refers to where to get current value (e.g., localStorage key)
}

export const APP_FACTS: AppFact[] = [
  // ARCHITECTURE
  { 
    category: 'architecture', 
    key: 'tech_stack', 
    description: 'NovaChat is built with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, and Tailwind CSS v4. The backend is Node.js + Express.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },
  { 
    category: 'architecture', 
    key: 'styling_theme', 
    description: 'The UI features a dark, futuristic PS5-console-inspired cosmic theme with procedural glowing ambient waves.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },

  // UI NAVIGATION
  { 
    category: 'ui', 
    key: 'sidebar', 
    description: 'Sidebar.tsx handles conversation list, new chat, session rename/delete, and settings trigger.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },
  { 
    category: 'ui', 
    key: 'main_chat_view', 
    description: 'ChatArea.tsx renders the persona selector, search indicator, token usage meter, and the message list with SourcePanel.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },
  { 
    category: 'ui', 
    key: 'input_composer', 
    description: 'InputBar.tsx contains the auto-growing textarea, attachment drop zone, and stop stream button.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },

  // MODELS & PROVIDERS (DYNAMIC)
  { 
    category: 'models', 
    key: 'primary_model', 
    description: 'The active model is currently set to:', 
    isDynamic: true, 
    dataKey: 'novachat_settings_v2' // We will parse this for the model field at runtime
  },

  // FEATURES
  { 
    category: 'features', 
    key: 'image_generation', 
    description: 'Powered by Pollinations AI using the Flux model (1024x1024) with a download proxy at /api/download-image.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },
  { 
    category: 'features', 
    key: 'memory_system', 
    description: 'A hybrid memory subsystem using LocalStorage, server-side JSON (data/memory.json), and SQLite (memory_corrections.db) for audit trails.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  },
  { 
    category: 'limitations', 
    key: 'cloud_sync', 
    description: 'Multi-user Cloud SQL sync is NOT configured. Data storage is local to the browser and the server disk.', 
    isDynamic: false 
  }
];

// Helper to dynamically build the context string for the system prompt
export function getRelevantAppKnowledge(categories: string[]): string {
  const relevantFacts = APP_FACTS.filter(fact => categories.includes(fact.category));

  let dynamicContext = "";
  relevantFacts.forEach(fact => {
    if (fact.isDynamic && fact.dataKey) {
      // Fetch current value from localStorage to inject as ground truth
      try {
        const settingsStr = localStorage.getItem(fact.dataKey);
        if (settingsStr) {
          const settings = JSON.parse(settingsStr);
          // Example: extract active model
          if (fact.key === 'primary_model') {
             dynamicContext += `- Active Model: ${settings.activeModel || 'Default (LLaMA 3.3 70B)'}\n`;
          }
        }
      } catch (e) {
        // Silently fail if localStorage parsing fails, fallback to static
      }
    }
  });

  let baseContext = relevantFacts
    .filter(f => !f.isDynamic)
    .map(f => `- ${f.key}: ${f.description}`)
    .join('\n');

  return `NOVACHAT APPLICATION FACTS (Verified via Codebase & Runtime State):\n${baseContext}\n${dynamicContext}`;
}
```

### ⚡ Phase 2: The "Self-Awareness" Trigger (`src/services/selfAwarenessEngine.ts`)
Ye engine detect karega ki user apne baare mein pooch raha hai, aur phir sirf **relevant** categories fetch karega.

```typescript
// src/services/selfAwarenessEngine.ts

export function detectSelfAwarenessQuery(userMessage: string): string[] {
  const message = userMessage.toLowerCase();
  const categories = new Set<string>();

  // UI & Interface Queries
  if (message.includes('ui') || message.includes('interface') || message.includes('dikhta') || message.includes('look') || message.includes('design')) {
    categories.add('ui');
  }

  // Settings & Config
  if (message.includes('settings') || message.includes('config') || message.includes('model') || message.includes('api')) {
    categories.add('models');
    categories.add('features');
  }

  // Architecture & Codebase
  if (message.includes('code') || message.includes('architecture') || message.includes('backend') || message.includes('frontend') || message.includes('typescript') || message.includes('react')) {
    categories.add('architecture');
  }

  // Capabilities & Features
  if (message.includes('feature') || message.includes('capable') || message.includes('can you') || message.includes('voice') || message.includes('image') || message.includes('memory')) {
    categories.add('features');
    categories.add('limitations');
  }

  // Specific Identifiers
  if (message.includes('novachat') || message.includes('your app') || message.includes('tumhara app')) {
    categories.add('ui');
    categories.add('architecture');
    categories.add('models');
  }

  return Array.from(categories);
}
```

### 🔌 Phase 3: Integrate into `server.ts` Pipeline
Ab hum `server.ts` ko update karenge. Yaad rakho, **default system prompt VERBATIM** preserve karna hai. Hum extra context ko `dynamic_context` variable ke through append karenge.

*(Note: Since `server.ts` is Node.js and `localStorage` is browser-side, the frontend MUST send the dynamic state in the payload, OR we use a shared context service that runs on the frontend before POSTing to `/api/chat`.)*

**Better Approach (Front-Matter Injection):**
`App.tsx` mein, request bhejne se pehle:

```typescript
// In App.tsx or the function that handles /api/chat POST

async function handleSend() {
  // 1. Detect if user is asking about self
  const selfAwarenessCategories = detectSelfAwarenessQuery(userInput);

  let appContextPayload = "";

  if (selfAwarenessCategories.length > 0) {
    // 2. Fetch the formatted knowledge string
    appContextPayload = getRelevantAppKnowledge(categories);
  }

  // 3. POST to backend
  const response = await fetch('/api/chat', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      messages: chatHistory,
      currentSettings: localStorage.getItem('novachat_settings_v2'), // Pass raw settings for backend to parse safely
      dynamicAppContext: appContextPayload, // Pass only relevant facts
      // ... other fields
    })
  });

  // ... handle SSE stream
}
```

